      "title": "Contact",
      "type": "text",
      "header": {
        "title": "",
        "meta": "",
        "quote": "",
        "description": "If you'd like me to photograph your wedding, email me here. Please include:\nYour names\nYour wedding date\nThe venue or town\nA rough guest count\nTell me a little about the day you're planning and how you found me. If you'd like to share your Instagram handle, I'm always glad to put faces to names.\nI'll reply with my packages and we can set up a video call to talk it through.",
